  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Settle into a relaxed beach stay in beautiful Inlet Beach where comfort and convenience shape every part of your visit. This thoughtfully designed three bedroom home is a great fit for families and small groups who want an easy Florida getaway without feeling cramped or rushed.<br><br>Inside, two king bedrooms provide quiet, hotel level comfort for adults, while additional beds allow kids or extra guests to spread out comfortably. With two full bathrooms and one half bath, mornings move smoothly and everyone has space to reset after a day at the beach.<br><br>The living area stays cool and comfortable year round, making it just as inviting to unwind indoors as it is to explore outside. Whether you are returning from a beach day, sharing meals together, or enjoying a quiet evening in, the home feels welcoming and practical in all the right ways.<br><br>This Inlet Beach home is designed to remove friction from your trip. Comfortable beds, dependable climate control, and a calm coastal setting make it easy to relax quickly and focus on what matters most time together and time away.<br><br>Why guests love this Inlet Beach home<br><br>• Three bedroom layout designed for families and small groups<br>• Two full bathrooms plus one half bath for easy mornings and evenings<br>• Bunk room with two twin over full bunks ideal for kids and mixed age groups<br>• Primary bedroom with direct access to the back patio<br>• Cool and comfortable living space with reliable air conditioning<br>• Outdoor shower for easy beach rinsing<br>• Private back patio with dining table for al fresco meals<br>• Grill for relaxed family dinners at home<br>• Easy indoor outdoor flow that makes the home feel open and livable<br>• Calm residential setting close to the beach access on 30A<br><br>DWE7605774",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
